  "question": {
    "text": "In an ammeter, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of the main current passes through the galvanometer. If resistance of the galvanometer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the resistance of ammeter will be:",
